      "uid": "zhcn:c8db0f0614be824645dcf966",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……对北港火山来说，\n奇锐骏是一直跑在前方的伟大前辈。",
      "source_fingerprint": "965e5a8ca45646739da98853516ad71255471104dc4890bc7dfab0526dcf848d",
