      "uid": "zhcn:f064b85666ef1ffb4d970987",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "决定下次挑战的目标是“JBC经典赛”后，\n北港火山开始为其做准备……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2a247499103b22e21a0d17612508da0378c221a432e6f4db4f19a9be4c75bd42",
